What:		/sys/bus/iio/devices/iio:deviceX/lane_mode
KernelVersion:	6.12
Contact:	linux-iio@vger.kernel.org
Description:
		Interface lane mode of the AXI AD404x data capture core. It must
		match the output lane mode of the device.

What:		/sys/bus/iio/devices/iio:deviceX/lane_mode_available
KernelVersion:	6.12
Contact:	linux-iio@vger.kernel.org
Description:
		Reading returns a list with the lane modes that can be written
		to lane_mode: "dual", "single", "half" and "quarter".
